{"seq":12,"slug":"property-law","title":"物权法","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law","rating":{"composite":4.01,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 物权法\n\n物权法是民法的核心支柱，界定人对财产所享有的权利及其归属、利用与流转。\"这是我的\"——这句话背后，是一个关乎人与人围绕财产之关系的法律世界。本知识库以**中国现行法**为坐标：物权法不再是独立法律，而是《中华人民共和国民法典》第二编\"物权编\"（第 205-462 条，2021 年 1 月 1 日施行，吸收并废止 2007 年《物权法》）。我们以民法典具体条文、真实制度（不动产统一登记、居住权、数据三权分置）为骨架，系统讲解从所有权到流转、从担保到争议的核心原理，面向无需法律背景、希望理解财产权这一现代社会基础概念的读者。\n\n## 本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n本 hub 聚焦**物权**（对物的直接支配权，绝对权）。与之相邻的兄弟知识库各有分工，请勿在本 hub 重复展开：\n\n- **本 hub（物权法）**：所有权、占有、用益物权、担保物权、物权变动、不动产登记——围绕\"对物的支配\"。\n- [合同法](../02_contract-law/_INTRODUCTION.md)：债权（对人请求权）一侧。物权变动常以合同为原因行为（买卖→交付/登记），但\"债权 vs 物权\"的区分与债的规则在彼处展开。\n- [侵权法](../11_tort-law/_INTRODUCTION.md)：物权受侵害的损害赔偿救济在彼处；本 hub 只讲物权请求权（返还/排妨/消险）。\n- [知识产权法](../04_intellectual-property/_INTRODUCTION.md)：无体财产权（专利/著作权/商标），与物权相关但非物权。\n- [法律基础](../01_legal-fundamentals/_INTRODUCTION.md)：民事权利、法律行为、诉讼时效等总则性概念是本 hub 的前置。\n\n## 推荐学习路径与前置\n\n前置知识：建议先读 [法律基础·民事权利](../01_legal-fundamentals/3_civil-law-basics/1_civil-rights.md) 建立民事权利的总体框架。\n\n第一章 **物权法基础**：界定物权法的对象与体系定位、所有权四项权能、\"对物权 vs 对人权\"这把关键钥匙。第二章 **所有权与占有**：剖析最完整的所有权、作为事实状态的占有、物权请求权保护。第三章 **不动产**：考察土地房屋的特殊规则——不动产与动产之分、不动产登记、相邻关系。第四章 **财产权的取得与转让**：原始/继受取得、转让的公示规则（交付与登记）、善意取得。第五章 **他物权与意义**：担保物权与用益物权（在他人之物上的有限物权）、财产权的社会功能、争议与数字时代挑战。\n\n建议按章顺读：基础概念（一章）→核心权利（二章）→不动产实务（三章）→变动规则（四章）→他物权与升华（五章）。读完你将理解\"所有权\"这一现代社会的基础概念，掌握中国物权法的条文骨架，并对财产法如何支撑市场与秩序多一分洞察。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"物权法基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-property-law","title":"什么是物权法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/foundations/what-is-property-law"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ownership-powers","title":"所有权及其权能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/foundations/ownership-powers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-vs-personal-rights","title":"对物权与对人权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/foundations/real-vs-personal-rights"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ownership-and-possession","title":"所有权与占有","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/ownership-and-possession","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ownership","title":"所有权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/ownership-and-possession/ownership"},{"seq":2,"slug":"possession","title":"占有","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/ownership-and-possession/possession"},{"seq":3,"slug":"protection","title":"物权的保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/ownership-and-possession/protection"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-property","title":"不动产","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/real-property","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"real-property-specialty","title":"不动产的特殊性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/real-property/real-property-specialty"},{"seq":2,"slug":"registration","title":"不动产登记","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/real-property/registration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"neighboring-relations","title":"相邻关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/real-property/neighboring-relations"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"acquisition-and-transfer","title":"财产权的取得与转让","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/acquisition-and-transfer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"original-and-derivative","title":"原始取得与继受取得","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/acquisition-and-transfer/original-and-derivative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transfer-and-delivery","title":"转让与公示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/acquisition-and-transfer/transfer-and-delivery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"good-faith-acquisition","title":"善意取得","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/acquisition-and-transfer/good-faith-acquisition"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"limited-rights-significance","title":"他物权与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/limited-rights-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"security-interests","title":"担保物权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/limited-rights-significance/security-interests"},{"seq":2,"slug":"usufructuary-rights","title":"用益物权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/limited-rights-significance/usufructuary-rights"},{"seq":3,"slug":"functions","title":"财产权的社会功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/limited-rights-significance/functions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"争议与当代挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/property-law/limited-rights-significance/significance"}]}]}